From: Devin <devin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:24:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix singular exiled-card placement

Lower singular “a/an card exiled this way” wording to an up-to-one tracked zone choice and a single-object move, preserving the selected-object haste and delayed-return continuation. Plural mass-move wording remains unchanged.

